  "start": "hub",
  "nodes": {
    "hub": {
      "text": "哟，被告的还敢到处敲门。胆子够硬。问吧，老范我嘴不贵，但也不白送。",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "又来了？你的事我听说了——王大爷的证词是假的？哼，我就说嘛。你还要问什么？",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "evasive",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "self_cleared"
            },
            {
              "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "……你都知道了。阿贵那小子嘴比我松。行，你问吧。反正我也跑不了。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "defeated",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "说说当晚的事",
          "goto": "intro",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "为什么走那条航道？",
          "goto": "ask_route",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "fan_talked_once"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true,
          "min_hub_visits": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "本地人都知道那条路危险，你跑了二十年不知道？",
          "goto": "press_route",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "clue": "clue_reef_common_knowledge"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "你是怎么获救的？",
          "goto": "ask_rescue",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "fan_talked_once"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true,
          "min_hub_visits": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "你那条船，船底以前修过没有？",
          "goto": "show_hull",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "evidence": "evidence_hull_hole"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "听说你最近手头有点紧？",
          "goto": "show_iou",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "evidence": "evidence_gambling_iou"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "四十二两赌债，怎么欠出来的？",
          "goto": "ask_gambling_story",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "clue": "clue_fan_boat_skill"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "阿贵已经招了。那个'药材行的姑娘'——是她先找你的吧？",
          "goto": "press_shen_connection",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "intro": {
      "set_flags": [
        "fan_talked_once"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "嗐，天灾嘛。那夜雨大浪急，我跑了二十年漕线，烟杆都没见过那阵仗。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "smirk"
        },
        {
          "text": "过了石矶嘴子，一个涌头打过来——'咔嚓'一声底板就裂了。船旧了，水又急，谁也扛不住。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "smirk",
          "record_type": "testimony",
          "record_title": "证词记录：老范的撞礁说",
          "record_text": "老范声称夜船行至礁石水道后，被浪头打得船底裂开。",
          "highlight": [
            "礁石",
            "船底就裂了"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "二十年老船家翻了船，一个脏字都没骂？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "腊月江水泡半个时辰……你确定没记错？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "我水性好嘛，吃这碗江饭的人，落了水也得想法子活。那主仆两个……唉，没能捞上来。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "smirk"
        },
        {
          "text": "翻了船死了人，他还在这讲故事……要么是没心没肺，要么是心里有底。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "anxious"
        },
        {
          "text": "这也太顺了吧。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_route": {
      "text": "周老板说赶早市，码头上又有人把东汊说得近。我想着绕大弯太费时，就拣了那条水路。\n\n嗐，我也知道有礁石。但水涨了以后，以前那礁石应该没过去了嘛。谁知道还露着。",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "周老板说赶早市，码头上又有人把东汊说得近。我想着绕大弯太费时，就拣了那条水路。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        },
        {
          "text": "嗐，我也知道有礁石。但水涨了以后，以前那礁石应该没过去了嘛。谁知道还露着。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "defensive"
        },
        {
          "text": "老范，你跑了二十年。涨水后礁石还在不在，你比我清楚。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "他在赌，赌你不会细查。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "determined"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "press_route": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "嗐，陆公子这话说的……涨水嘛，水面高了礁石就该没了。走漕的人看水吃饭，偶尔也会被水呛一口。这、这能全怪我？",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "defensive",
          "record_type": "testimony",
          "record_title": "证词记录：老范的航道辩解",
          "record_text": "老范辩称水涨后礁石应当被没过，自己只是判断失误。",
          "highlight": [
            "涨水",
            "判断失误"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "判断失误？他走了二十年！闭着眼都能走。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "determined"
        },
        {
          "text": "……",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_rescue": {
      "set_flags": [
        "fan_alibi_contradiction"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "我水性好嘛。泡了……泡了有半个时辰。江饭吃久了，水里也能咬牙熬一阵。后来有船经过，把我捞上来的。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "smirk",
          "record_type": "testimony",
          "record_title": "证词记录：老范获救时间",
          "record_text": "老范声称自己在水中泡了半个时辰后被人救起。",
          "highlight": [
            "半个时辰"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "半个时辰？腊月的江水，半个时辰能把人泡成冰棍。他是鱼吗？",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "shocked"
        },
        {
          "text": "我身体硬朗嘛。年轻时候在江里扎猛子，一两个时辰都扛过。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "defensive"
        },
        {
          "text": "半个时辰……你确定？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "半个时辰和一刻钟……这差得也太多了吧。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "worried"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "show_hull": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "修……修过？哪条船不修呢。船跑久了要捻缝补板，这都是常事。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "不过翻船之前没动过！那是礁石撞的！",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "defensive"
        },
        {
          "text": "他急了！一问船底就急。心里没鬼的人不会这样。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "determined"
        },
        {
          "text": "船上有捻凿和桐油。你解释一下。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "你在躲。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "determined"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "show_iou": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "手头紧？谁、谁跟你说的？我日子过得好好的！",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "defensive"
        },
        {
          "text": "跑船嘛，有时多赚有时少赚……年关难过，水浅船沉，谁家不紧巴？",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "四十二两……腊月底还不上就断指。这不是年关难过，是要命。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "determined"
        },
        {
          "text": "四十二两……谁给他兜的底？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "angry"
        },
        {
          "text": "没人兜底。老头子自己欠的债，自己认。陆公子别把什么事都往别人身上扯。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "defensive"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_gambling_story": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "……你问这个干嘛。跟案子有关系？",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan"
        },
        {
          "text": "二十年的老船家，怎么沾上的赌？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "……嗐。说来话长。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "dismissive"
        },
        {
          "text": "五年前。我家小子——刚十二岁。一场急病，烧了三天三夜不退。大夫说得用辽东参，一两就要八钱银子。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "我攒了一辈子的跑船钱不够。找人借——码头上谁肯借给一个穷船夫？最后有人说'赌坊有快钱'……",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "谁跟你说的？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "cold"
        },
        {
          "text": "……孩子后来怎样了？",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "worried"
        },
        {
          "text": "(她问这句话的时候声音轻了很多。)",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "worried"
        },
        {
          "text": "没了。药没凑齐。腊月二十三走的——小年夜。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "cornered"
        },
        {
          "text": "赌坊的钱没赚到——倒欠了一屁股。之后就……越赌越深。想翻本。翻不了。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "……",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "陆公子。我不是好人。但我也不是天生的赌鬼。那年孩子没了以后，我就没稳住。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "cornered"
        },
        {
          "text": "……",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "press_shen_connection": {
      "set_flags": [
        "fan_confessed_shen"
      ],
      "gain_clue": "evidence_shen_connection",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "老范。阿贵招了。该你了。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "cold"
        },
        {
          "text": "找你商量的人，是个做药材的姑娘。对不对？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "cold"
        },
        {
          "text": "烟杆从嘴边落了下来。整个人僵住。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "……陆公子都知道了？",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "cornered"
        },
        {
          "text": "说。她怎么找上你的。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "cold"
        },
        {
          "text": "她开了什么条件？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "cold"
        },
        {
          "text": "……是她先来的。在我常去的茶馆坐了一下午，一句话没说，就把我那张欠条放在桌上。然后才开口——说有门生意，做完了赌债一笔勾销。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "cornered"
        },
        {
          "text": "我问什么生意。她说——'把船弄沉就行。其他的不用管。你水性好，淹不死你。'……她连我水性好都查过了。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "cornered"
        },
        {
          "text": "我……我当时被逼急了。年底不还钱赌坊说要断指……",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "cornered"
        },
        {
          "text": "她连老范的水性都查过了……这不是临时起意。",
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "emotion": "anxious"
        },
        {
          "text": "那个姑娘，什么样？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "cold"
        },
        {
          "text": "高个子。穿劲装。说话利索——像是做过生意的人。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan",
          "emotion": "cornered"
        },
        {
          "text": "……沈清月。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
